# Generated artefacts.  Both are rewritten in full by `python tools/run_bench.py`
# on every run, so committing them would leave the working tree permanently
# dirty and make `git status --porcelain` useless as a health signal.  They stay
# on disk (the compliance maps reference them as evidence) but are not tracked.
